const slots=[...rules.SLOTS],multiple=new Set(['gpu','ram','ssd','hdd','fan']),slotLabels={cpu:'Processor',board:'Motherboard',gpu:'Graphics card',ram:'Memory kit',ssd:'SSD',hdd:'Hard drive',psu:'Power supply',case:'Case',fan:'Case fans',cooler:'CPU cooler',storage:'Storage'};
